WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:04.000
<i>I</i> have been entrusted
<i>with</i> nothing less

00:04.250 --> 00:06.130
<i>than the future of mankind.</i>

00:06.550 --> 00:09.090
<i>Winning the Ultimate Prize
may be our only chance</i>

00:09.260 --> 00:11.800
<i>to survive the Crog invasion.</i>

00:12.550 --> 00:14.350
<i>But the Grand Finals</i>

00:14.520 --> 00:17.640
are exposing the team
to even greater risks.

00:18.060 --> 00:20.730
<i>That includes
my daughter, Eva,</i>

00:20.940 --> 00:22.940
<i>known to all of us here as Molly.</i>

00:24.190 --> 00:27.990
<i>Even the powerful Sul fell victim
to some diabolical trap.</i>

00:28.780 --> 00:30.740
<i>How will this all end?</i>

01:50.820 --> 01:52.700
I can't believe Sui's gone.

01:53.110 --> 01:55.910
Stan and Koji said he was lost
in a magnetic storm,

01:56.070 --> 01:57.280
a very rare phenomenon.

01:57.870 --> 01:59.620
It could've happened to anyone.

02:01.750 --> 02:03.870
He was no friend of mine.

02:05.960 --> 02:08.710
But he was
the strongest pilot on Oban,

02:08.880 --> 02:10.670
way stronger than any of us.

02:11.840 --> 02:14.970
I'm sure this isn't
the last we'll hear from him.

02:16.260 --> 02:17.600
Molly?

02:18.220 --> 02:19.510
What are you...

02:19.680 --> 02:22.060
I hate to tell you this,
but I think you've dozed off.

02:28.730 --> 02:32.320
It's all right, Molly.
You can rest all you want.

02:33.150 --> 02:35.240
It was a tough night.

02:57.340 --> 02:58.430
Good morning!

03:03.060 --> 03:04.180
Good morning?

03:04.350 --> 03:05.940
Uh, I mean, sir...

03:08.520 --> 03:10.070
Don't go. Keep me warm.

03:11.820 --> 03:14.030
Uh, we just talked
all night long.

03:14.190 --> 03:16.450
And... and wow, we fell asleep.

03:17.160 --> 03:19.490
Could you please
excuse us, Jordan?

03:19.660 --> 03:22.870
I have some things
to discuss with Molly alone.

03:23.040 --> 03:25.580
<i>Of course.
I'll just... clean...</i>

03:25.750 --> 03:28.000
...clean the guns.
Yeah, that again.

03:36.170 --> 03:39.550
This competition is no longer
about the race.

03:39.850 --> 03:42.930
There are dark forces
at work here,

03:43.390 --> 03:46.020
forces much greater
than all of us.

03:47.390 --> 03:48.440
Is this about Sul?

03:48.900 --> 03:50.560
I have no proof,

03:50.730 --> 03:54.070
but whoever
or whatever took him away,

03:54.230 --> 03:57.950
was a force beyond comprehension,
a dangerous force.

03:58.610 --> 03:59.410
What do you mean?

04:00.030 --> 04:01.740
I mean that I can no longer

04:01.910 --> 04:04.200
let you risk your life for this race,

04:04.370 --> 04:06.580
even for the Ultimate Prize.

04:06.710 --> 04:07.910
-But sir...
-Eva.

04:09.500 --> 04:11.920
I know that you are my daughter.

04:24.260 --> 04:25.600
Hey, Molly, what's wrong?

04:26.390 --> 04:27.560
Wait!

04:29.940 --> 04:31.810
Don Wei's at it again.

04:32.690 --> 04:36.280
Just like I told you, Koji.
He's completely heartless.

04:49.500 --> 04:50.500
Eva?

04:59.800 --> 05:00.720
Up here.

05:20.780 --> 05:23.820
I've imagined this moment
for a very long time.

05:24.620 --> 05:27.370
I would rush into your arms,
and you would hug me.

05:27.540 --> 05:29.790
And all those lost years
would be forgiven.

05:29.960 --> 05:31.370
But now that it's happened,

05:31.830 --> 05:33.080
I don't feel a thing.

05:33.250 --> 05:34.580
There is...

05:35.340 --> 05:38.050
so much to explain to you, Eva,

05:38.210 --> 05:41.340
and so many reasons
why you must hate me.

05:43.430 --> 05:44.430
Try me.

05:47.640 --> 05:50.100
After your mother's
terrible crash, I...

05:52.980 --> 05:55.310
I completely fell to pieces.

06:02.070 --> 06:04.240
<i>My world was destroyed.</i>

06:07.660 --> 06:09.790
<i>Maya was the love of my life.</i>

06:09.950 --> 06:12.620
<i>She was an amazing pilot.</i>

06:21.590 --> 06:22.880
<i>I pushed her to compete</i>

06:23.050 --> 06:25.640
<i>in the First
interplanetary Championship.</i>

06:36.230 --> 06:39.480
<i>In just a few years,
she'd become a legend,</i>

06:39.650 --> 06:42.820
<i>the first pilot ever to win
all three league titles.</i>

06:46.780 --> 06:50.160
I knew this would be
the crowning moment of her career.

06:50.330 --> 06:52.790
She was quite simply the best.

07:03.920 --> 07:07.760
<i>She made it to the finals
with her usual ease,</i>

07:08.010 --> 07:11.220
<i>totally oblivious
to the dangers around her.</i>

07:11.600 --> 07:13.430
<i>That was her charm.</i>

07:21.650 --> 07:24.190
<i>But the race took its toll.</i>

07:24.900 --> 07:26.700
<i>I could feel it.</i>

07:27.280 --> 07:29.530
The other finalist
was an alien,

07:29.700 --> 07:33.540
one of these strange
polymorphic creatures, a Phils.

07:33.950 --> 07:35.000
Spirit.

07:35.290 --> 07:38.880
He had the reputation of being
a very aggressive pilot.

07:56.180 --> 07:58.520
<i>I had misgivings
about that race,</i>

07:58.940 --> 08:01.520
<i>a dark premonition
of what was to came.</i>

08:05.150 --> 08:07.860
<i>Naturally,
she wouldn't listen.</i>

08:08.780 --> 08:10.240
<i>'Nun.</i>

08:10.620 --> 08:13.410
As long as we can fly,
we still have a chance.

08:20.960 --> 08:23.290
I failed to stop her.

08:27.300 --> 08:28.840
Here they come, Daddy!

08:29.010 --> 08:30.760
-I can't see.
-OK, Eva.

08:31.180 --> 08:32.510
Time for a piggyback.

08:32.720 --> 08:34.180
There. Is that better?

08:34.810 --> 08:37.890
Yes. I can see her.
She's winning, she's winning!

08:44.980 --> 08:48.820
I was...
and I continue to be...

08:48.990 --> 08:51.320
a danger for those I love.

08:54.830 --> 08:56.790
I couldn't have you near me.

08:57.700 --> 09:00.500
I couldn't risk harming you as well.

09:24.060 --> 09:27.190
<i>You reminded me
too much of Maya.</i>

09:30.400 --> 09:32.240
There was only one thing to do.

10:00.100 --> 10:03.020
Ah, look who's here,
our little Eva.

10:05.610 --> 10:07.360
How are you, honey?

10:09.980 --> 10:11.740
Welcome to the Stern Boarding School,

10:12.240 --> 10:13.320
my dear.

10:17.030 --> 10:18.370
Daddy!

10:20.540 --> 10:21.540
-Daddy!
-Come along, now.

10:26.250 --> 10:29.250
Please don't leave me too, Daddy.

10:32.510 --> 10:35.510
It was the hardest thing
I've ever done.

10:36.220 --> 10:38.560
But I did it for you, Eva.

10:45.520 --> 10:47.310
Why didn't you ever call me?

10:49.190 --> 10:51.730
Why didn't you ever write?

10:52.940 --> 10:54.700
Why didn't you ever visit me?

10:55.860 --> 10:56.740
Why?

10:57.320 --> 10:59.030
<i>'Nun.</i>

10:59.490 --> 11:01.080
It wasn't possible.

11:01.580 --> 11:03.580
I wasn't myself anymore.

11:07.250 --> 11:10.670
<i>A man with no name and no past.</i>

11:11.380 --> 11:13.460
I was a shadow of myself.

11:13.760 --> 11:16.010
A few years later,
that shadow

11:16.180 --> 11:19.180
managed a racing team,
the best on Earth.

11:19.640 --> 11:21.100
You think I didn't know?

11:21.680 --> 11:23.520
<i>Fantastic victory, Don Wei.</i>

11:23.680 --> 11:25.350
<i>How do you explain your success?</i>

11:25.890 --> 11:28.730
My team trusts each other
and respects each other.

11:30.900 --> 11:33.030
We're like a close family, really.

11:34.070 --> 11:35.070
Everyone knew!

11:35.700 --> 11:37.910
Why didn't you contact me then?

11:38.070 --> 11:39.030
I'm sorry.

11:39.700 --> 11:41.200
I still couldn't face you.

11:41.530 --> 11:46.660
I was the one who destroyed
your mother and our family.

11:49.000 --> 11:52.090
I saw your face
so often in the magazines.

11:53.130 --> 11:55.880
I just told myself
that you were too busy to visit.

11:58.260 --> 11:59.640
<i>I was so proud of you.</i>

12:12.110 --> 12:14.440
<i>I got it into my head
to become a pilot.</i>

12:14.900 --> 12:16.780
I waited around like an idiot
for the moment

12:16.950 --> 12:19.570
you'd suddenly
drop from the sky without warning.

12:48.230 --> 12:50.940
<i>The other children thought
I was an orphan.</i>

12:52.360 --> 12:54.980
And they were right.
I had no one!

12:56.230 --> 12:58.440
I'm so sorry, Eva.

12:58.780 --> 13:00.570
I really wish you were.

13:00.740 --> 13:03.240
The day I finally ran away
from school and met you,

13:03.410 --> 13:05.290
you didn't even recognize me!

13:07.620 --> 13:09.750
-Who are you?
-I'm...

13:10.080 --> 13:11.330
I'm...

13:18.630 --> 13:19.340
I'm...

13:22.800 --> 13:23.970
Spit it out!

13:25.010 --> 13:27.140
-I'm...
-We haven't got all day!

13:34.940 --> 13:35.980
I'm Molly.

13:38.150 --> 13:40.570
How could I not see...

13:41.820 --> 13:44.910
I broke my neck for you
for 17 races

13:45.070 --> 13:47.080
before you finally understood.

13:47.620 --> 13:49.660
What a joke.
To you, I was dead!

13:50.160 --> 13:51.580
I didn't exist!

14:04.550 --> 14:06.510
What can they be talking about
for so long?

14:06.680 --> 14:07.970
The race is about to start.

14:08.390 --> 14:10.140
He's lecturing her again.

14:10.730 --> 14:13.770
Nothing this team does
is ever good enough for that robot.

14:13.940 --> 14:14.980
Poor girl.

14:16.690 --> 14:17.690
I've got to go.

14:18.730 --> 14:20.400
You still intend to race?

14:21.030 --> 14:22.150
More than ever.

14:25.780 --> 14:28.120
I have no right to stop you.

14:28.580 --> 14:29.990
But I'd like you to reconsider.

14:30.330 --> 14:32.790
I couldn't bear
to lose you again.

14:39.590 --> 14:41.170
Listen! I hear something.

14:52.020 --> 14:53.390
What are you waiting for?

14:53.680 --> 14:55.770
We have a race!
Get to your posts.

15:15.160 --> 15:17.250
<i>I've got to win
the Ultimate Prize.</i>

15:17.960 --> 15:21.460
<i>For you, for mother, for me.</i>

15:22.550 --> 15:24.720
<i>It's the only way
to erase the pain...</i>

15:25.550 --> 15:27.090
<i>for all of us.</i>

15:27.680 --> 15:28.720
All systems are go.

15:35.520 --> 15:37.560
<i>Then we can be
together again...</i>

15:37.980 --> 15:39.110
<i>...like before.</i>

16:30.450 --> 16:32.200
Huh? What's going on?

16:36.370 --> 16:38.410
It seems to be a deep canyon.

16:38.870 --> 16:40.540
A very deep canyon.

16:42.170 --> 16:44.170
Very deep?
It's nearly bottomless.

16:45.420 --> 16:47.300
Push the lift reactors
to the maximum.

16:47.420 --> 16:49.180
Until we sort out
what's down there,

16:49.470 --> 16:52.140
I want you up in the air
as long as possible.

16:52.260 --> 16:52.930
Yes, sir.

17:02.520 --> 17:04.360
Fall stabilized at 10%.

17:04.690 --> 17:05.650
Great, Molly.

17:06.280 --> 17:08.570
You should be perfectly
positioned for the next gate.

17:11.610 --> 17:13.160
I hope you're right, Koji.

17:16.700 --> 17:18.870
You're third,
with two more gates to go.

17:20.410 --> 17:21.790
Did you hear that, Molly?

17:21.960 --> 17:23.290
Are we good or what?

17:38.850 --> 17:41.060
Keep still, wandering eye.

17:41.480 --> 17:43.730
You cannot escape your fate.

18:10.130 --> 18:11.260
Eva!

18:21.810 --> 18:22.640
Molly!

18:36.450 --> 18:37.700
We've lost communication.

18:48.340 --> 18:50.300
Molly, do something!

18:51.460 --> 18:53.090
I'm doing everything I can!

19:01.430 --> 19:03.430
<i>I guess it was just a dream.</i>

19:03.640 --> 19:05.770
<i>We'll never be together again.</i>

19:19.910 --> 19:21.950
No answer. Nothing at all.

19:22.290 --> 19:24.870
Don't worry about it, sir.
It happened once before.

19:25.210 --> 19:27.420
I'm sure that they're OK.
I know we can reach them.

19:29.710 --> 19:31.630
No, not this time.

19:31.840 --> 19:33.260
I can feel it.

19:41.430 --> 19:44.020
I destroyed my wife...

19:44.350 --> 19:47.600
and now
I've destroyed my only child.

19:54.030 --> 19:55.820
Molly, Jordan, come in.

19:55.950 --> 19:56.900
Can you hear me?

19:57.070 --> 19:58.660
It's no use, Koji.

19:59.990 --> 20:01.910
They can't hear you anymore.

20:02.660 --> 20:04.040
No, it can't be!
